{"type":"after","callId":"call@141","endTime":113392.372,"result":{"value":"Skip to main content\nFG\nFoothills Golf Studio\nROADMAP COACH WORKSPACE\nOverview\nGolfers\nDrill library\nRoadmap templates\nMedia\nPackages\nPlan & billing\nSettings\nCR\nCoach Rowan\nvisual.coach@example.test\nSign out\nPRIVATE COACHING MEDIA\nMedia library\n\nUpload once, then reuse a swing clip, image, or source CSV in coaching content. Roadmap never analyzes the swing or claims a live device integration.\n\nUpload media\nNEW UPLOAD\nAdd a private file\nUp to 48 MB · video up to 3:00\nImage, swing video, or source CSV\nThe original stays private and is not published by uploading it.\nAccessible description\nView or orientation label\nCaptured date\nFrame orientation\nDetect later / unknown\nLandscape\nPortrait\nSquare\nCaption\nCoach context\nOptional poster and transcript\nUpload privately\n\nUpload complete. It remains coach-only until you attach it to coaching content and publish that revision.\n\nREUSABLE ASSETS\nYour private library\n1 stored item\nREADY\nSynthetic poster for private swing clips\nIMAGE\n\nSynthetic poster frame for B video evidence\n\nCAPTURED\nAug 10, 2026\nVIEW\nPoster landscape\nFILE\n16 KB\n\nSynthetic QA poster only; no diagnosis or outcome claim.\n\nReplace\nRemove"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@141"}
